#~ " one day to the next and "
#~ "reaches the new caches just as "
#~ "they appear. The route is computed "
#~ "automatically when playback or recording "
#~ "starts. Indicative route reconstructed from"
#~ " find dates: the actual order of "
#~ "visits is unknown and the line "
#~ "follows neither roads nor terrain."

